1
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,564
Welcome to media E R P.

2
00:00:05,604 --> 00:00:10,176
This short guide shows the employee workflow,
step by step.

3
00:00:10,785 --> 00:00:14,589
Sign in with your work email and password.

4
00:00:15,327 --> 00:00:17,664
The Overview is your home.

5
00:00:17,704 --> 00:00:22,728
It shows your tasks at a glance, and what
needs attention today.

6
00:00:23,356 --> 00:00:24,929
Open Projects.

7
00:00:24,969 --> 00:00:26,966
This is your board.

8
00:00:27,006 --> 00:00:30,721
Every task you own sits in one of six columns.

9
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,351
Pending is new work.

10
00:00:33,391 --> 00:00:36,569
Started is what you are working on now.

11
00:00:36,609 --> 00:00:38,733
Break is paused work.

12
00:00:38,773 --> 00:00:41,928
Pending Review is waiting for your leader.

13
00:00:41,968 --> 00:00:43,918
Approved is finished.

14
00:00:43,958 --> 00:00:47,164
Reedit is work sent back for changes.

15
00:00:47,794 --> 00:00:52,686
Open a task to see the full brief, the due
date, and any files.

16
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,554
Press Start when you begin.

17
00:00:55,594 --> 00:00:57,932
This starts your timer.

18
00:00:58,542 --> 00:01:01,909
The timer records how long you actually work.

19
00:01:01,949 --> 00:01:05,329
It runs only while the task is Started.

20
00:01:05,924 --> 00:01:07,578
Going for a break?

21
00:01:07,618 --> 00:01:09,059
Press Break.

22
00:01:09,099 --> 00:01:12,919
The timer pauses, so your time stays accurate.

23
00:01:13,541 --> 00:01:15,982
Press Start again to resume.

24
00:01:16,022 --> 00:01:18,916
The timer continues where it stopped.

25
00:01:19,539 --> 00:01:21,286
Attach your work.

26
00:01:21,326 --> 00:01:25,151
Drag and drop any file, up to one gigabyte.

27
00:01:25,191 --> 00:01:27,761
Large videos are fine.

28
00:01:28,374 --> 00:01:34,782
When the work is done, press Submit for Review
and add a short note about what you did.

29
00:01:35,352 --> 00:01:37,897
The task moves to Pending Review.

30
00:01:37,937 --> 00:01:40,321
Your leader now checks it.

31
00:01:40,942 --> 00:01:43,915
If it is good, the leader approves it.

32
00:01:43,955 --> 00:01:48,377
The task moves to Approved, and your total
time is saved.

33
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:53,771
If something needs changing, it comes back as
Reedit, with the reason.

34
00:01:53,811 --> 00:01:57,491
Read the reason, fix it, and start again.

35
00:01:58,105 --> 00:02:03,830
Media Schedule shows your planned shoots and
posts, so you know what is coming.

36
00:02:04,394 --> 00:02:06,476
Chat is for your team.

37
00:02:06,516 --> 00:02:12,604
Each team has a group, and a daily report is
posted automatically every evening.

38
00:02:13,231 --> 00:02:15,672
The bell shows notifications.

39
00:02:15,712 --> 00:02:21,221
Important updates are also sent to your email,
so nothing is missed.

40
00:02:21,852 --> 00:02:24,501
That is the full employee workflow.

41
00:02:24,541 --> 00:02:27,719
Start, track, submit, and repeat.

42
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:29,078
Thank you.
